# RULE: UI Icons (Lucide)

Read before any renderer UI task that adds or changes icons.

## Source of truth

```txt
docs/softphone/Icon-Agent-Guide.md
docs/softphone/Icon-Registry.md
src/renderer/components/icons/iconCatalog.ts
```

## Mandatory

1. Use `AppIcon` with **semantic id** from `IconSemanticId` — no direct `lucide-react` / `lucide-animated` imports in `components/`, `shells/`, `widgets/`.
2. Prefer **animated** when catalog provides `animated`; else static.
3. Update **registry + catalog** in the same PR when adding icons.
4. Icon-only controls: `aria-label` on interactive parent; `AppIcon decorative`.
5. Sizes: `var(--icon-size-sm|md|lg)` or explicit `size` prop.

## Forbidden

- Raw Lucide imports in feature UI files
- New icons without registry entry
- Text + icon duplication on icon-only buttons (labels deferred to tooltip WU)
- Icons in Domain, Application, adapters, or stores

## Deferred

Semantic icon-only UI + 1s hover tooltips → `handoffs/P11-Icon-Tooltips-Agent-Prompt.md` (do not implement without explicit user request).

